  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - General Electric National Image and Data Repository Pilot Project Feasibility Study, through General Electric Company</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant funds a pilot project for the Indonesian Ministry of Health (MoH) to conduct a pilot for the development of a national image and data repository (NIDR), which will serve as a cloud-based centralized warehouse for patient records and interpretive reports used for treatment. The pilot would support an overarching Project by demonstrating the viability of the NIDR through a focused approach for cardiac treatment for the transmission of electrocardiogram (ECG) readings, which will be implemented for a subset of ten primary care and hospital facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
